## Why This Is Asked

Tests design of a real-time sync surface with offline resilience, cross‑platform native bridge, and robust delivery guarantees.

## Key Concepts

- Durable WebSocket bridge in React Native
- Offline queue stored locally (SQLite/Realm)
- Exponential backoff on reconnects
- Idempotent handlers and messageId for at-least-once delivery
- TypeScript hook useWebSocketSync for replaying missed messages
- Testing strategies for intermittent connectivity

## Code Example

